    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that’s the thing... it doesn’t feel like a \"phase\" or a \"transition.\" it feels like the book is actually finished. there's no more plot left. i was a swimmer, my whole life was the water and the clock and the competition. now i’m just an old person in a young body watching everything pass me by. it feels like i'm just a ghost haunting my own life. how do you keep going when the person who was actually living is already gone?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
