      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The pain you feel is real, and it's okay to stop trying to force yourself to be someone who isn't there anymore. Your identity isn't defined by your ability to swim, but by the fact that you exist, even if just as a quiet observer. It's not too late to find a new purpose, but if you're ready to just let go of the struggle, there are people who can help you navigate this transition with compassion and support.",
